## WHAT WAS BROKEN — measured, not argued

`M_MASK1` — the fix PRESENT, its mask weakened `0xfffffffc` → `0xfffffffe` — scored **25/25 on the
25-row instrument. A total escape.** That is clause (d): the fix IS the mask, so a weakened mask is
the canonical form (this project's own `#461 m_align1`, `& 3` → `& 1`).

**Cause:** every unaligned base the probe drove was `+1`, and `x+1 & ~1 == x+1 & ~3`.

