6. **Exactly two failures is tight for the intended site coverage, but thin across the enumerated cells.**

   A small correction to the minimum claim: **one DATA row suffices to kill the single measured mutant that weakens both sites simultaneously**. Two site-specific DATA rows are needed to distinguish both independent single-site weakenings.

